<amll:meta key="album" value="海屿你2.0"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1872607534"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:58.368"><div begin="24.428" end="35.768" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="24.428" end="26.143" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.428" end="24.661">让</span><span begin="24.661" end="24.794">我</span><span begin="24.794" end="25.042">怎</span><span begin="25.042" end="25.169">幺</span><span begin="25.169" end="25.408">放</span><span begin="25.408" end="25.508">得</span><span begin="25.508" end="26.143">下</span></p><p begin="26.153" end="28.847" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.153" end="26.794">你流的泪</span><span begin="26.794" end="27.237">混杂着</span><span begin="27.237" end="27.693">疼痛</span><span begin="27.693" end="28.194">逼着我</span><span begin="28.194" end="28.417">回</span><span begin="28.417" end="28.847">答</span></p><p begin="28.915" end="31.662" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.915" end="29.394">生锈的</span><span begin="29.394" end="29.824">回忆</span><span begin="29.824" end="30.525">透进骨髓</span><span begin="30.525" end="31.024">我们就</span><span begin="31.024" end="31.239">作</span><span begin="31.239" end="31.662">罢</span></p><p begin="31.748" end="34.466" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.748" end="33.217">曾坚定无比的信念</span><span begin="33.217" end="33.831">也惨烈的</span><span begin="33.831" end="33.982">崩</span><span begin="33.982" end="34.466">塌</span></p><p begin="34.562" end="35.768" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.562" end="34.902">想你</span> <span begin="34.902" end="35.276">我错</span><span begin="35.276" end="35.462">了</span><span begin="35.462" end="35.768">吗</span></p></div><div begin="35.778" end="48.656" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="35.778" end="38.660" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.778" end="36.768">是我命中渡的</span><span begin="36.768" end="37.296">劫</span> <span begin="37.412" end="38.260">我想我办不</span><span begin="38.260" end="38.660">到</span></p><p begin="38.763" end="41.593" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.763" end="39.399">秋风眷恋</span><span begin="39.399" end="39.706">枯</span><span begin="39.706" end="40.128">叶</span> <span begin="40.249" end="40.882">这生活像</span><span begin="40.882" end="41.085">毒</span><span begin="41.085" end="41.593">药</span></p><p begin="41.603" end="44.397" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.603" end="42.623">每口都灼烧着</span><span begin="42.623" end="43.026">喉咙</span><span begin="43.026" end="43.766">可是我戒</span><span begin="43.766" end="43.912">不</span><span begin="43.912" end="44.397">掉</span></p><p begin="44.407" end="47.075" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.407" end="45.802">明知道该怎麼遗忘</span><span begin="45.802" end="46.539">却反复受</span><span begin="46.539" end="46.700">煎</span><span begin="46.700" end="47.075">熬</span></p><p begin="47.085" end="48.656" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.085" end="47.964">每个深夜的</span><span begin="47.964" end="48.084">咆</span><span begin="48.084" end="48.656">哮</span></p></div><div begin="48.086" end="59.371" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.086" end="50.925" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.086" end="48.671">发疯的</span> <span begin="48.671" end="49.223">拼命的</span> <span begin="49.223" end="50.380">抹去你存在过的</span><span begin="50.380" end="50.549">痕</span><span begin="50.549" end="50.925">迹</span></p><p begin="50.935" end="54.026" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.935" end="51.403">重复的</span> <span begin="51.403" end="51.973">深刻的</span> <span begin="51.973" end="52.906">像旧伤复发</span><span begin="52.906" end="53.240">不肯</span><span begin="53.240" end="53.429">痊</span><span begin="53.429" end="54.026">愈</span></p><p begin="54.099" end="56.500" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.099" end="55.129">付出真心换来</span><span begin="55.129" end="55.662">多深刻</span><span begin="55.662" end="55.891">的</span><span begin="55.891" end="56.179">教</span><span begin="56.179" end="56.500">训</span></p><p begin="56.510" end="59.371" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.510" end="57.344">如果没有我</span> <span begin="57.344" end="58.241">你会幸福吧</span> <span begin="58.241" end="58.757">我想过</span><span begin="58.757" end="59.010">也</span><span begin="59.010" end="59.371">许</span></p></div><div begin="59.381" end="1:12.757" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="59.381" end="1:02.762" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.381" end="1:00.689">我们最相爱的时候</span><span begin="1:00.689" end="1:01.519">是每个无声</span><span begin="1:01.519" end="1:01.824">的</span><span begin="1:01.824" end="1:02.158">哽</span><span begin="1:02.158" end="1:02.762">咽</span></p><p begin="1:02.807" end="1:05.662" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.807" end="1:03.503">却结束在</span><span begin="1:03.503" end="1:04.743">海水都结冰的</span><span begin="1:04.743" end="1:05.049">季</span><span begin="1:05.049" end="1:05.662">节</span></p><p begin="1:05.672" end="1:12.757" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.672" end="1:06.620">我原谅不了</span><span begin="1:06.620" end="1:06.915">自己</span> <span begin="1:06.915" end="1:07.233">求你</span><span begin="1:07.233" end="1:07.497">别</span><span begin="1:07.497" end="1:07.971">离</span><span begin="1:07.971" end="1:09.098">开</span><span begin="1:09.098" end="1:12.757">我</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.503" end="1:35.563" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.503" end="1:15.036" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.503" end="1:11.957">比起不爱你</span><span begin="1:11.957" end="1:12.930">更让我</span><span begin="1:12.930" end="1:13.388">心</span><span begin="1:13.388" end="1:15.036">疼</span></p><p begin="1:15.253" end="1:21.105" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.253" end="1:16.281">能不能</span><span begin="1:16.281" end="1:16.960">稍作</span><span begin="1:16.960" end="1:17.396">停</span><span begin="1:17.396" end="1:17.920">留</span> <span begin="1:18.120" end="1:19.096">看一眼</span><span begin="1:19.096" end="1:19.952">残破</span><span begin="1:19.952" end="1:20.278">的</span><span begin="1:20.278" end="1:21.105">我</span></p><p begin="1:21.260" end="1:29.249" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.260" end="1:22.653">可我偏又</span><span begin="1:22.653" end="1:22.998">不</span><span begin="1:22.998" end="1:23.746">松</span><span begin="1:23.746" end="1:24.276">手</span> <span begin="1:24.504" end="1:26.926">是命中注定惩罚</span><span begin="1:26.926" end="1:27.553">我的</span><span begin="1:27.553" end="1:27.927">冲</span><span begin="1:27.927" end="1:29.249">动</span></p><p begin="1:29.338" end="1:35.563" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.338" end="1:30.376">是将我</span><span begin="1:30.376" end="1:31.366">占</span><span begin="1:31.366" end="1:32.231">有</span><span begin="1:32.231" end="1:32.694">的</span><span begin="1:32.694" end="1:33.111">魔</span><span begin="1:33.111" end="1:35.563">咒</span></p></div><div begin="1:44.269" end="1:55.972" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="1:44.269" end="1:46.100" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:44.269" end="1:45.272">那就收好我的</span><span begin="1:45.272" end="1:45.541">抱</span><span begin="1:45.541" end="1:46.100">歉</span></p><p begin="1:46.185" end="1:48.889" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.185" end="1:47.011">不好的情绪</span><span begin="1:47.011" end="1:48.053">蔓延密布在我</span><span begin="1:48.053" end="1:48.432">房</span><span begin="1:48.432" end="1:48.889">间</span></p><p begin="1:49.004" end="1:51.682" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:49.004" end="1:50.080">孤单如影随形</span> <span begin="1:50.080" end="1:50.870">企图遮蔽我</span><span begin="1:50.870" end="1:51.138">视</span><span begin="1:51.138" end="1:51.682">线</span></p><p begin="1:51.842" end="1:54.359" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:51.842" end="1:53.037">最近总出现我们</span><span begin="1:53.037" end="1:53.679">曾经美好</span><span begin="1:53.679" end="1:54.052">错</span><span begin="1:54.052" end="1:54.359">觉</span></p><p begin="1:54.369" end="1:55.972" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:54.369" end="1:55.138">就放过我的</span><span begin="1:55.138" end="1:55.402">世</span><span begin="1:55.402" end="1:55.972">界</span></p></div><div begin="1:55.343" end="2:07.149" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:55.343" end="1:58.741" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.343" end="1:56.328">所以我发疯的</span> <span begin="1:56.328" end="1:56.921">拼命的</span> <span begin="1:56.921" end="1:58.120">抹去你存在过的</span><span begin="1:58.120" end="1:58.357">痕</span><span begin="1:58.357" end="1:58.741">迹</span></p><p begin="1:58.751" end="2:01.842" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.751" end="1:59.219">重复的</span> <span begin="1:59.219" end="1:59.789">深刻的</span> <span begin="1:59.789" end="2:00.722">像旧伤复发</span><span begin="2:00.722" end="2:01.056">不肯</span><span begin="2:01.056" end="2:01.245">痊</span><span begin="2:01.245" end="2:01.842">愈</span></p><p begin="2:01.859" end="2:04.248" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.859" end="2:02.745">手心的温度</span><span begin="2:02.745" end="2:03.639">消失在岁月</span><span begin="2:03.639" end="2:03.896">间</span><span begin="2:03.896" end="2:04.248">隙</span></p><p begin="2:04.258" end="2:07.149" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.258" end="2:04.734">我想要</span><span begin="2:04.734" end="2:05.072">靠近</span> <span begin="2:05.072" end="2:06.395">但是噩梦总会把我</span><span begin="2:06.395" end="2:06.706">叫</span><span begin="2:06.706" end="2:07.149">醒</span></p></div><div begin="2:07.159" end="2:21.554" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:07.159" end="2:10.570" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.159" end="2:08.361">我们最相爱的时候</span><span begin="2:08.361" end="2:09.657">是每个无声的</span><span begin="2:09.657" end="2:09.947">哽</span><span begin="2:09.947" end="2:10.570">咽</span></p><p begin="2:10.580" end="2:13.444" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.580" end="2:12.157">却结束在海水都结冰</span><span begin="2:12.157" end="2:12.467">的</span><span begin="2:12.467" end="2:12.786">季</span><span begin="2:12.786" end="2:13.444">节</span></p><p begin="2:13.454" end="2:21.554" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.454" end="2:14.675">我原谅不了自己</span> <span begin="2:14.675" end="2:15.375">求你别</span><span begin="2:15.375" end="2:15.675">离</span><span begin="2:15.675" end="2:16.727">开</span><span begin="2:16.727" end="2:21.554">我</span></p></div><div begin="2:18.259" end="2:43.976" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:18.259" end="2:22.792" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.259" end="2:19.713">比起不爱你</span><span begin="2:19.713" end="2:20.686">更让我</span><span begin="2:20.686" end="2:21.144">心</span><span begin="2:21.144" end="2:22.792">疼</span></p><p begin="2:23.014" end="2:28.866" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.014" end="2:24.042">能不能</span><span begin="2:24.042" end="2:24.721">稍作</span><span begin="2:24.721" end="2:25.157">停</span><span begin="2:25.157" end="2:25.681">留</span> <span begin="2:25.881" end="2:26.857">看一眼</span><span begin="2:26.857" end="2:27.713">残破</span><span begin="2:27.713" end="2:28.039">的</span><span begin="2:28.039" end="2:28.866">我</span></p><p begin="2:28.994" end="2:36.983" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.994" end="2:30.387">可我偏又</span><span begin="2:30.387" end="2:30.732">不</span><span begin="2:30.732" end="2:31.480">松</span><span begin="2:31.480" end="2:32.010">手</span> <span begin="2:32.238" end="2:34.660">是命中注定惩罚</span><span begin="2:34.660" end="2:35.287">我的</span><span begin="2:35.287" end="2:35.661">冲</span><span begin="2:35.661" end="2:36.983">动</span></p><p begin="2:37.134" end="2:43.976" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.134" end="2:38.172">是将我</span><span begin="2:38.172" end="2:39.162">占</span><span begin="2:39.162" end="2:40.027">有</span><span begin="2:40.027" end="2:40.490">的</span><span begin="2:40.490" end="2:40.907">魔</span><span begin="2:40.907" end="2:43.976">咒</span></p></div></body></tt>